263 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T ("Scaling API security is a fundamental challenge. As organizations deploy more APIs to meet digital demands, their security processes are falling behind. Our research shows that a majority of APIs are left unmanaged, which not only exposes data, but also magnifies risk at every level of operation.")
/E ("Scaling API security is a fundamental challenge. As organizations deploy more APIs to meet digital demands, their security processes are falling behind. Our research shows that a majority of APIs are left unmanaged, which not only exposes data, but also magnifies risk at every level of operation.")
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
