/ActualText (Exposed Secrets: The report found 1,816 highly sensitive secrets exposed within API environments, including access tokens, API keys, and authentication credentials. These exposed secrets significantly heighten the risk of unauthorized access and potential misuse of critical systems.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
