/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Among the exposed APIs, we identified at least 198 critical vulnerabilities, including various CVEs and OWASP Top 10 risks, such as API2:2023: Broken Authentication and API8:2023: Security Misconfiguration. These vulnerabilities include risks that could allow unauthorized access to sensitive data, privilege escalation, and potential unauthorized control over critical applications. The nature and distribution of these vulnerabilities indicate a systemic gap in security practices across development environments, as many of these APIs lack proper access control, authentication, and monitoring.)
/E (Among the exposed APIs, we identified at least 198 critical vulnerabilities, including various CVEs and OWASP Top 10 risks, such as API2:2023: Broken Authentication and API8:2023: Security Misconfiguration. These vulnerabilities include risks that could allow unauthorized access to sensitive data, privilege escalation, and potential unauthorized control over critical applications. The nature and distribution of these vulnerabilities indicate a systemic gap in security practices across development environments, as many of these APIs lack proper access control, authentication, and monitoring.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [5]
>>
